<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>AM Premium — Dashboard</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
<link rel="icon" href="image/am.png" type="image/png">
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  :root { --clr-a: #00f0ff; --clr-b: #ff00e5; --clr-c: #9d00ff; --clr-d: #00ff9d; --clr-base: #05010f; }
  html { height: 100%; }
  body {
    min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'Courier New', monospace;
    background: var(--clr-base); color: #e0f7ff;
    overflow-x: hidden; visibility: hidden; padding-bottom: 100px;
  }
  body.sess-ok { visibility: visible; }
  .grd-bg {
    position: fixed; inset: 0;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(0,240,255,0.05) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,0,229,0.05) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 40px 40px;
    z-index: 0; pointer-events: none;
  }
  .glow-blob { display: none; }
  .lines-overlay { display: none; }
  .top-avatar-wrap { position: fixed; top: 16px; right: 16px; z-index: 60; display: none; cursor: pointer; }
  .top-avatar-wrap.show { display: block; }
  .top-avatar { position: relative; width: 52px; height: 52px; border-radius: 50%; }
  .top-avatar-wrap:hover .top-avatar { transform: scale(1.05); }
  .top-avatar-wrap:active .top-avatar { transform: scale(0.97); }
  .top-avatar::before {
    content: ""; position: absolute; inset: -3px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: conic-gradient(from 0deg, var(--clr-a), var(--clr-b), var(--clr-c), var(--clr-a));
    z-index: -1;
  }
  .top-avatar::after { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: -1px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(10,5,25,1); z-index: -1; }
  .top-avatar .avatar-inner { position: absolute; inset: 0; border-radius: 50%; overflow: hidden; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 900; color: #fff; font-size: 20px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--clr-c), var(--clr-b)); box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.4); }
  .top-avatar .avatar-inner img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
  .top-avatar-wrap .online-dot { position: absolute; bottom: 2px; right: 2px; width: 13px; height: 13px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--clr-d); border: 2px solid rgba(10,5,25,1); box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--clr-d); z-index: 2; }
  .page-wrap { position: relative; z-index: 2; flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 20px 16px; gap: 18px; }
  .tab-page { display: none; width: 100%; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 18px; }
  .tab-page.active { display: flex; }
  .card-box { width: 100%; max-width: 560px; background: rgba(10, 5, 25, 0.82); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.35); border-radius: 18px; padding: 30px 26px 24px; box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.15), 0 0 40px rgba(157, 0, 255, 0.12); position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .top-area { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 22px; }
  .brand-logo { width: 90px; height: 90px; margin: 0 auto 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 10px var(--clr-a)); }
  .brand-logo img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; display: block; }
  .brand-name { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 3px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--clr-a), var(--clr-b), var(--clr-c)); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .brand-sub { color: #7dd3fc; font-size: 11.5px; margin-top: 5px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; opacity: 0.75; }
  .progress-bar { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 22px; }
  .prog-node { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 7px 14px; border-radius: 30px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.25); color: #64748b; transition: all 0.3s; }
  .prog-node i { font-size: 12px; }
  .prog-node.active { color: #fff; border-color: var(--clr-a); background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0,240,255,0.15), rgba(255,0,229,0.15)); box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.3); }
  .prog-node.done { color: var(--clr-d); border-color: rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.5); }
  .prog-arrow { color: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.35); font-size: 12px; }
  .view-section { display: none; }
  .view-section.active { display: block; }
  .lbl-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--clr-a); margin-bottom: 8px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.2px; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .lbl-row i { font-size: 12px; }
  .inp-box { position: relative; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .inp-box input, .inp-box textarea { width: 100%; padding: 14px 14px 14px 44px; background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.04); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.25); border-radius: 10px; color: #e0f7ff; font-size: 14px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; outline: none; transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s; resize: vertical; }
  .inp-box textarea { min-height: 90px; padding-top: 14px; }
  .inp-box input::placeholder, .inp-box textarea::placeholder { color: #4b5563; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; }
  .inp-box input:focus, .inp-box textarea:focus { border-color: var(--clr-a); background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.08); }
  .ico-left { position: absolute; left: 14px; top: 15px; color: var(--clr-a); font-size: 15px; pointer-events: none; }
  .inp-box textarea + .ico-left { top: 15px; }
  .act-btn { width: 100%; padding: 15px; border: none; border-radius: 10px; color: #fff; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; position: relative; overflow: hidden; transition: transform 0.2s; }
  .act-btn-main { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--clr-c), var(--clr-b), var(--clr-a)); box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255, 0, 229, 0.3); }
  .act-btn-main:hover:not(:disabled) { transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .act-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.65; cursor: not-allowed; }
  .act-btn-back { background: transparent; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.3); color: #7dd3fc; margin-top: 10px; font-size: 12px; padding: 11px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; }
  .act-btn-back:hover { border-color: var(--clr-a); background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.08); }
  .msg-box { margin-top: 18px; padding: 14px 16px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.65; display: none; word-break: break-word; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; }
  .msg-box.show { display: block; }
  .msg-box.ok { background: rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.4); color: #86efac; }
  .msg-box.fail { background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.45); color: #fca5a5; }
  .msg-box.pend { background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.4); color: #93c5fd; }
  .msg-box pre { background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); padding: 10px; border-radius: 6px; overflow-x: auto; font-size: 11px; margin-top: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.2); }
  .tut-card { width: 100%; max-width: 560px; background: rgba(10, 5, 25, 0.82); border: 1px solid rgba(157, 0, 255, 0.4); border-radius: 18px; padding: 24px 22px 22px; box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(157, 0, 255, 0.15); position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .tut-header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 18px; padding-bottom: 14px; border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.25); }
  .tut-header .tut-icon { width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 12px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(157, 0, 255, 0.3), rgba(255, 0, 229, 0.3)); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.4); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #fff; font-size: 18px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .tut-header .tut-title-box { text-align: left; }
  .tut-header .tut-title { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--clr-a), var(--clr-c), var(--clr-b)); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text; }
  .tut-header .tut-sub { font-size: 10.5px; color: #94a3b8; letter-spacing: 1px; margin-top: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; }
  .tut-step { display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 12px 0; position: relative; text-align: left; }
  .tut-step:not(:last-child) { border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.08); }
  .tut-num { width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 50%; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--clr-c), var(--clr-b)); color: #fff; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 900; font-size: 13px; flex-shrink: 0; border: 2px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.5); font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; }
  .tut-body { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
  .tut-body .tut-name { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin-bottom: 4px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
  .tut-body .tut-name i { color: var(--clr-a); font-size: 12px; }
  .tut-body .tut-desc { font-size: 11.5px; color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.6; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; }
  .tut-body .tut-desc b { color: var(--clr-a); font-weight: 700; }
  .tut-body .tut-desc code { color: var(--clr-d); background: rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.08); padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.25); font-size: 10.5px; }
  .tut-note { margin-top: 16px; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 10px; background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.25); font-size: 11px; color: #93c5fd; line-height: 1.7; text-align: left; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: flex-start; }
  .tut-note i { color: var(--clr-a); font-size: 14px; margin-top: 1px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .tut-warn { margin-top: 10px; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 10px; background: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.35); font-size: 11px; color: #fcd34d; line-height: 1.7; text-align: left; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: flex-start; }
  .tut-warn i { color: #fbbf24; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 1px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .tt-card { width: 100%; max-width: 560px; background: rgba(10, 5, 25, 0.82); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 0, 229, 0.4); border-radius: 18px; padding: 30px 26px 24px; box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 0, 229, 0.15); position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .tt-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 22px; }
  .tt-logo { width: 80px; height: 80px; margin: 0 auto 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 10px var(--clr-b)); }
  .tt-logo i { font-size: 58px; color: #fff; text-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--clr-a); }
  .tt-name { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 3px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--clr-b), var(--clr-c), var(--clr-a)); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .tt-sub { color: #f0abfc; font-size: 11.5px; margin-top: 5px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; opacity: 0.75; }
  .tt-src-lbl { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin: 14px 0 8px; }
  .tt-src-tabs { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 6px; background: rgba(255, 0, 229, 0.04); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 0, 229, 0.25); border-radius: 12px; padding: 4px; }
  .tt-src { padding: 9px 4px; background: transparent; border: none; color: #64748b; font-family: inherit; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.8px; text-transform: uppercase; cursor: pointer; border-radius: 8px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 3px; transition: all 0.2s; }
  .tt-src i { font-size: 12px; }
  .tt-src small { font-size: 8px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.5px; opacity: 0.7; text-transform: none; }
  .tt-src.active { background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 0, 229, 0.35), rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.3)); color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 0, 229, 0.25); }
  .tt-src:hover:not(.active) { color: #cbd5e1; background: rgba(255, 0, 229, 0.06); }
  .tt-src-hint { font-size: 10px; color: #94a3b8; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; margin-top: 7px; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.5; min-height: 14px; }
  .tt-src-hint b { color: #f0abfc; }
  .tt-badges { display: flex; gap: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .tt-badge { font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 4px 9px; border-radius: 20px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.35); color: #7dd3fc; background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.06); }
  .tt-badge.hd { border-color: rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.5); color: #86efac; background: rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.08); }
  .tt-badge.sd { border-color: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.5); color: #fcd34d; background: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.08); }
  .tt-badge.src { border-color: rgba(255, 0, 229, 0.5); color: #f0abfc; background: rgba(255, 0, 229, 0.08); }
  .tt-result { margin-top: 20px; display: none; }
  .tt-result.show { display: block; }
  .tt-info-card { background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.04); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.25); border-radius: 14px; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .tt-author { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding-bottom: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.15); }
  .tt-author-avatar { width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid var(--clr-a); object-fit: cover; flex-shrink: 0; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--clr-c), var(--clr-b)); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 900; color: #fff; font-size: 18px; }
  .tt-author-info { flex: 1; min-width: 0; text-align: left; }
  .tt-author-name { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; letter-spacing: 0.5px; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
  .tt-author-handle { font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; margin-top: 2px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; }
  .tt-stats { display: flex; gap: 14px; justify-content: space-around; text-align: center; }
  .tt-stat { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 3px; }
  .tt-stat i { color: var(--clr-a); font-size: 13px; }
  .tt-stat .num { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; }
  .tt-stat .lbl { font-size: 9px; color: #94a3b8; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .tt-title { font-size: 12.5px; color: #e0f7ff; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: left; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; padding: 10px 12px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3); border-radius: 8px; border-left: 3px solid var(--clr-a); word-break: break-word; }
  .tt-cover-wrap { position: relative; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 14px; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.25); background: #000; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 200px; }
  .tt-cover-wrap img, .tt-cover-wrap video { width: 100%; max-height: 400px; object-fit: contain; display: block; }
  .tt-dl-group { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 9px; }
  .tt-dl-btn { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; padding: 13px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none; color: #fff; font-family: inherit; transition: transform 0.2s; position: relative; overflow: hidden; border: none; cursor: pointer; }
  .tt-dl-btn-primary { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--clr-c), var(--clr-b), var(--clr-a)); box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255, 0, 229, 0.3); }
  .tt-dl-btn-primary:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .tt-dl-btn-secondary { background: transparent; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.4); color: #7dd3fc; }
  .tt-dl-btn-secondary:hover { background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.08); border-color: var(--clr-a); color: #fff; }
  .tt-slides { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(110px, 1fr)); gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .tt-slide-item { position: relative; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.25); background: #000; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; }
  .tt-slide-item:hover { border-color: var(--clr-a); }
  .tt-slide-item img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
  .tt-slide-item .slide-dl { position: absolute; bottom: 6px; right: 6px; width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(10, 5, 25, 0.9); border: 1px solid var(--clr-a); color: #fff; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-decoration: none; font-size: 12px; }
  .tt-slide-item .slide-dl:hover { background: var(--clr-a); color: #000; }
  .tt-slide-item .slide-num { position: absolute; top: 6px; left: 6px; background: rgba(10, 5, 25, 0.9); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.4); color: var(--clr-a); padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; }
  .tm-card { width: 100%; max-width: 560px; background: rgba(10, 5, 25, 0.82); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.4); border-radius: 18px; padding: 30px 26px 24px; box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.15); position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .tm-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 22px; }
  .tm-logo { width: 80px; height: 80px; margin: 0 auto 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 10px var(--clr-d)); }
  .tm-logo i { font-size: 52px; color: #fff; text-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--clr-d); }
  .tm-name { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 3px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--clr-d), var(--clr-a), var(--clr-c)); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .tm-sub { color: #6ee7b7; font-size: 11.5px; margin-top: 5px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; opacity: 0.75; }
  .tm-email-show { background: rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.4); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 14px 14px 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
  .tm-email-show.empty { opacity: 0.5; }
  .tm-email-show .tm-icon-box { width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 9px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.25), rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.2)); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.5); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--clr-d); font-size: 15px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .tm-email-show .tm-email-txt { flex: 1; min-width: 0; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 13px; color: #fff; font-weight: 700; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; letter-spacing: 0.3px; }
  .tm-copy-btn { width: 34px; height: 34px; border-radius: 8px; background: transparent; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.5); color: var(--clr-d); cursor: pointer; font-size: 13px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .tm-copy-btn:hover { background: rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.15); }
  .tm-copy-btn.copied { background: rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.25); color: #fff; }
  .tm-copy-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.4; cursor: not-allowed; }
  .tm-tabs { display: flex; background: rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.04); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.25); border-radius: 12px; padding: 4px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .tm-tab { flex: 1; padding: 9px 8px; background: transparent; border: none; color: #64748b; font-family: inherit; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 1.2px; text-transform: uppercase; cursor: pointer; border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 6px; }
  .tm-tab i { font-size: 12px; }
  .tm-tab.active { background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.3), rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.3)); color: #fff; }
  .tm-tab:hover:not(.active) { color: #cbd5e1; background: rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.06); }
  .tm-panel { display: none; }
  .tm-panel.active { display: block; }
  .tm-domain-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(140px, 1fr)); gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 14px; max-height: 160px; overflow-y: auto; padding-right: 4px; }
  .tm-domain-item { padding: 8px 10px; background: rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.04); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.2); border-radius: 8px; color: #94a3b8; font-size: 11px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; cursor: pointer; text-align: left; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
  .tm-domain-item:hover { background: rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.08); border-color: rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.5); color: #fff; }
  .tm-domain-item.selected { background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.2), rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.2)); border-color: var(--clr-d); color: #fff; }
  .tm-inbox-header { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 12px; margin-top: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .tm-inbox-title { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--clr-d); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.2px; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .tm-inbox-title i { font-size: 12px; }
  .tm-refresh-btn { background: transparent; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.35); color: var(--clr-d); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; }
  .tm-refresh-btn:hover { background: rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.1); border-color: var(--clr-d); }
  .tm-refresh-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.5; cursor: not-allowed; }
  .tm-refresh-btn.spinning i { animation: rotate 0.8s linear infinite; }
  @keyframes rotate { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
  .tm-auto-refresh { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: 10px; color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; cursor: pointer; user-select: none; padding: 6px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.25); background: rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.03); }
  .tm-auto-refresh:hover { background: rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.08); border-color: rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.5); }
  .tm-auto-refresh input[type="checkbox"] { display: none; }
  .tm-auto-refresh .tm-auto-box { width: 16px; height: 16px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1.5px solid rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.5); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .tm-auto-refresh .tm-auto-box i { font-size: 10px; opacity: 0; color: #05010f; }
  .tm-auto-refresh input:checked + .tm-auto-box { background: var(--clr-d); border-color: var(--clr-d); }
  .tm-auto-refresh input:checked + .tm-auto-box i { opacity: 1; }
  .tm-auto-refresh.active { color: var(--clr-d); border-color: var(--clr-d); background: rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.1); }
  .tm-inbox { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; min-height: 100px; }
  .tm-empty { text-align: center; padding: 24px 16px; color: #64748b; font-size: 11.5px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; border: 1px dashed rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.2); border-radius: 10px; background: rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.02); }
  .tm-empty i { display: block; font-size: 28px; color: rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.4); margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .tm-msg { background: rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.04); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.25); border-radius: 10px; padding: 11px 13px; cursor: pointer; text-align: left; }
  .tm-msg:hover { background: rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.08); border-color: rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.5); }
  .tm-msg-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .tm-msg-from { font-size: 12px; color: #fff; font-weight: 700; flex: 1; min-width: 0; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
  .tm-msg-dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--clr-d); flex-shrink: 0; }
  .tm-msg-subject { font-size: 11px; color: #cbd5e1; margin-bottom: 4px; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; }
  .tm-msg-date { font-size: 9.5px; color: #64748b; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
  .tm-msg-body { display: none; margin-top: 10px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px dashed rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.2); font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; line-height: 1.6; max-height: 260px; overflow-y: auto; word-break: break-word; }
  .tm-msg.open .tm-msg-body { display: block; }
  .tm-link-btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; margin-top: 8px; margin-right: 6px; padding: 7px 12px; border-radius: 8px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--clr-c), var(--clr-b), var(--clr-a)); color: #fff; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; border: none; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; }
  .tm-link-btn:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .tm-action-row { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .tm-action-btn { flex: 1; padding: 10px 8px; border-radius: 9px; background: transparent; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.35); color: var(--clr-d); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 5px; }
  .tm-action-btn i { font-size: 11px; }
  .tm-action-btn:hover:not(:disabled) { background: rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.1); border-color: var(--clr-d); }
  .tm-action-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.4; cursor: not-allowed; }
  .tm-action-btn.danger { border-color: rgba(255, 0, 229, 0.4); color: var(--clr-b); }
  .tm-action-btn.danger:hover:not(:disabled) { background: rgba(255, 0, 229, 0.1); border-color: var(--clr-b); }
  .api-wrap { width: 100%; max-width: 560px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; }
  .api-card { width: 100%; background: rgba(10, 5, 25, 0.82); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.35); border-radius: 18px; padding: 22px 20px 20px; box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.12); position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .api-card.api-am { border-color: rgba(157, 0, 255, 0.4); }
  .api-card.api-tiktok { border-color: rgba(255, 0, 229, 0.4); }
  .api-card.api-spotify { border-color: rgba(29, 185, 84, 0.4); }
  .api-card.api-mail { border-color: rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.4); }
  .api-card.api-youtube { border-color: rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.45); }
  .api-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding-bottom: 14px; margin-bottom: 16px; border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.22); }
  .api-ico { width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #fff; font-size: 18px; flex-shrink: 0; overflow: hidden; }
  .api-ico img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; display: block; padding: 6px; }
  .api-am .api-ico { background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(157, 0, 255, 0.35), rgba(255, 0, 229, 0.35)); border: 1px solid rgba(157, 0, 255, 0.6); }
  .api-tiktok .api-ico { background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 0, 229, 0.35), rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.35)); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 0, 229, 0.6); }
  .api-spotify .api-ico { background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(29, 185, 84, 0.35), rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.35)); border: 1px solid rgba(29, 185, 84, 0.6); }
  .api-mail .api-ico { background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.35), rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.35)); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.6); }
  .api-youtube .api-ico { background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.4), rgba(255, 0, 229, 0.3)); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.65); }
  .api-title-box { flex: 1; min-width: 0; text-align: left; }
  .api-title { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--clr-a), var(--clr-b), var(--clr-c)); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text; }
  .api-sub { font-size: 10.5px; color: #94a3b8; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 2px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; }
  .api-item { margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 12px 13px; background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.15); border-radius: 10px; text-align: left; }
  .api-item:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .api-item-name { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin-bottom: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .api-method { display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 5px; font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 1px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; }
  .api-method.get { color: #86efac; background: rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.12); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.4); }
  .api-method.post { color: #93c5fd; background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.12); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.4); }
  .api-url { font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--clr-a); font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; word-break: break-all; line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: 6px; padding: 7px 9px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4); border-radius: 6px; border-left: 2px solid var(--clr-a); }
  .api-desc { font-size: 10.5px; color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.65; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; }
  .api-desc b { color: var(--clr-a); font-weight: 700; }
  .api-desc code { color: var(--clr-d); background: rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.08); padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.25); font-size: 10px; }
  .api-code-toggle { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; margin-top: 9px; padding: 6px 11px; border-radius: 7px; background: transparent; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.3); color: #7dd3fc; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; }
  .api-code-toggle:hover { background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.08); border-color: var(--clr-a); color: #fff; }
  .api-code-toggle i { font-size: 9px; transition: transform 0.2s; }
  .api-code-toggle.open i { transform: rotate(90deg); }
  .api-code { display: none; margin-top: 9px; padding: 11px 13px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65); border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.22); font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 10.5px; line-height: 1.6; color: #cbd5e1; overflow-x: auto; white-space: pre; max-height: 320px; overflow-y: auto; }
  .api-code.show { display: block; }
  .api-code::-webkit-scrollbar { height: 6px; width: 6px; }
  .api-code::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3); }
  .api-code::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.35); border-radius: 3px; }
  .dl-tabs { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); width: 100%; max-width: 560px; background: rgba(10, 5, 25, 0.82); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240,255, 0.3); border-radius: 14px; padding: 5px; gap: 6px; box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.1); }
  .dl-tab { flex: 1; padding: 12px 8px; background: transparent; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 10px; color: #64748b; font-family: inherit; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; transition: all 0.2s; }
  .dl-tab i { font-size: 14px; }
  .dl-tab.active { background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(157, 0, 255, 0.3), rgba(255, 0, 229, 0.25), rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.25)); color: #fff; border-color: var(--clr-a); box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.25); }
  .dl-tab:hover:not(.active) { color: #cbd5e1; background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.05); }
  .dl-panel { display: none; width: 100%; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
  .dl-panel.active { display: flex; }
  .sp-card { width: 100%; max-width: 560px; background: rgba(10, 5, 25, 0.82); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.4); border-radius: 18px; padding: 30px 26px 24px; box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.15); position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .sp-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 22px; }
  .sp-logo { width: 80px; height: 80px; margin: 0 auto 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 10px #1db954); }
  .sp-logo i { font-size: 58px; color: #1db954; text-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(29, 185, 84, 0.8); }
  .sp-name { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 3px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1db954, var(--clr-a), var(--clr-b)); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .sp-sub { color: #6ee7b7; font-size: 11.5px; margin-top: 5px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; opacity: 0.75; }
  .sp-result { margin-top: 20px; display: none; }
  .sp-result.show { display: block; }
  .sp-badge { display: inline-block; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 9.5px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.5); color: #86efac; background: rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.08); margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .sp-coll { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.3); border-radius: 14px; }
  .sp-coll-icon { width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 12px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(29, 185, 84, 0.35), rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.25)); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.5); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #fff; font-size: 18px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .sp-coll-info { flex: 1; min-width: 0; text-align: left; }
  .sp-coll-title { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
  .sp-coll-sub { font-size: 10.5px; color: #94a3b8; margin-top: 3px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
  .sp-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
  .sp-track { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 10px 12px; background: rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.18); border-radius: 12px; transition: background 0.2s, border-color 0.2s; }
  .sp-track:hover { background: rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.07); border-color: rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.45); }
  .sp-track-num { width: 22px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 11px; color: #64748b; font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .sp-track-cover { width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 8px; object-fit: cover; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.35); flex-shrink: 0; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(29, 185, 84, 0.3), rgba(157, 0, 255, 0.3)); }
  .sp-track-info { flex: 1; min-width: 0; text-align: left; }
  .sp-track-title { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
  .sp-track-artist { font-size: 10.5px; color: #94a3b8; margin-top: 2px; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; }
  .sp-track-dur { font-size: 10.5px; color: #7dd3fc; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .sp-track-dl { width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 10px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(29, 185, 84, 0.3), rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.25)); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.5); color: #fff; cursor: pointer; font-size: 13px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; transition: transform 0.2s, background 0.2s; }
  .sp-track-dl:hover:not(:disabled) { transform: translateY(-2px); background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(29, 185, 84, 0.5), rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.4)); }
  .sp-track-dl:disabled { opacity: 0.5; cursor: not-allowed; }
  .sp-dl-box { margin-top: 8px; padding: 12px 14px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35); border: 1px dashed rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.4); border-radius: 10px; }
  .sp-dl-title { font-size: 11px; color: #6ee7b7; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; margin-bottom: 10px; word-break: break-word; line-height: 1.5; }
  .sp-dl-btns { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
  .sp-more { text-align: center; font-size: 10.5px; color: #64748b; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; margin-top: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .sp-single { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; padding: 16px; background: rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.04); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.3); border-radius: 14px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .sp-single-cover { width: 84px; height: 84px; border-radius: 12px; object-fit: cover; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.45); flex-shrink: 0; }
  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .sp-card { padding: 24px 18px 20px; }
    .sp-logo { width: 70px; height: 70px; }
    .sp-logo i { font-size: 48px; }
    .sp-name { font-size: 19px; letter-spacing: 2px; }
    .sp-single-cover { width: 64px; height: 64px; }
    .dl-tabs { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    .dl-tab { font-size: 11px; padding: 10px 6px; }
  }
  .sc-theme { width: 100%; display: flex; justify-content: center; }
  .sc-theme .sp-card { border-color: rgba(255, 138, 61, 0.28); box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 138, 61, 0.07); }
  .sc-theme .sp-logo { filter: drop-shadow(0 0 3px rgba(255, 138, 61, 0.3)); }
  .sc-theme .sp-logo i { color: #ff8a3d; text-shadow: 0 0 4px rgba(255, 138, 61, 0.2); }
  .sc-theme .sp-name { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff8a3d, #cbd5e1, var(--clr-a)); -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; }
  .sc-theme .sp-sub { color: #fdba74; }
  .sc-theme .sp-badge { border-color: rgba(255, 85, 0, 0.5); color: #fdba74; background: rgba(255, 85, 0, 0.08); }
  .sc-theme .sp-coll { background: rgba(255, 85, 0, 0.05); border-color: rgba(255, 85, 0, 0.3); }
  .sc-theme .sp-coll-icon { background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 85, 0, 0.35), rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.25)); border-color: rgba(255, 85, 0, 0.5); }
  .sc-theme .sp-track { background: rgba(255, 85, 0, 0.03); border-color: rgba(255, 85, 0, 0.18); }
  .sc-theme .sp-track:hover { background: rgba(255, 85, 0, 0.07); border-color: rgba(255, 85, 0, 0.45); }
  .sc-theme .sp-track-cover { border-color: rgba(255, 85, 0, 0.35); background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 85, 0, 0.3), rgba(157, 0, 255, 0.3)); }
  .sc-theme .sp-track-dl { background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 85, 0, 0.3), rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.25)); border-color: rgba(255, 85, 0, 0.5); }
  .sc-theme .sp-track-dl:hover:not(:disabled) { background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 85, 0, 0.5), rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.4)); }
  .sc-theme .sp-dl-box { border-color: rgba(255, 85, 0, 0.4); }
  .sc-theme .sp-dl-title { color: #fdba74; }
  .sc-theme .sp-single { background: rgba(255, 85, 0, 0.04); border-color: rgba(255, 85, 0, 0.3); }
  .sc-theme .sp-single-cover { border-color: rgba(255, 85, 0, 0.45); }
  .yt-theme { width: 100%; display: flex; justify-content: center; }
  .yt-theme .sp-card { border-color: rgba(255, 107, 107, 0.28); box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.07); }
  .yt-theme .sp-logo { filter: drop-shadow(0 0 3px rgba(255, 107, 107, 0.28)); }
  .yt-theme .sp-logo i { color: #ff6b6b; text-shadow: 0 0 4px rgba(255, 107, 107, 0.2); }
  .yt-theme .sp-name { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff7b7b, #c4b5fd, var(--clr-a)); -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; }
  .yt-theme .sp-sub { color: #fca5a5; }
  .yt-auto-hint { margin: -7px 0 16px; color: #94a3b8; font-size: 10.5px; line-height: 1.55; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; }
  .yt-auto-hint i { color: #ff4d4d; margin-right: 5px; }
  .yt-result { display: none; width: 100%; margin-top: 20px; }
  .yt-result.show { display: block; }
  .yt-meta { display: flex; gap: 13px; align-items: center; padding: 14px; margin-bottom: 13px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 48, 48, 0.32); border-radius: 14px; background: rgba(255, 48, 48, 0.045); }
  .yt-thumb { width: 116px; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; border-radius: 10px; object-fit: cover; background: #000; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 48, 48, 0.4); flex-shrink: 0; }
  .yt-meta-body { min-width: 0; flex: 1; text-align: left; }
  .yt-meta-title { color: #fff; font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.45; font-weight: 800; display: -webkit-box; -webkit-box-orient: vertical; -webkit-line-clamp: 3; overflow: hidden; word-break: break-word; }
  .yt-meta-sub { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 5px; margin-top: 8px; }
  .yt-chip { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; padding: 3px 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 48, 48, 0.42); border-radius: 20px; color: #fca5a5; background: rgba(255, 48, 48, 0.08); font-size: 9px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.7px; text-transform: uppercase; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; }
  .yt-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
  .yt-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 10px 11px; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.18); border-radius: 11px; background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.03); }
  .yt-item:hover { border-color: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.42); background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.06); }
  .yt-item-info { flex: 1; min-width: 0; text-align: left; }
  .yt-item-name { color: #fff; font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-word; }
  .yt-item-sub { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 9.5px; margin-top: 3px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; }
  .yt-item .tt-dl-btn { flex-shrink: 0; width: auto; min-width: 120px; padding: 9px 12px; font-size: 9.5px; letter-spacing: 0.8px; }
  .yt-empty { padding: 18px; text-align: center; color: #94a3b8; border: 1px dashed rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.25); border-radius: 11px; font-size: 11px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; }
  .yt-dl-progress { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 10px; }
  .yt-dl-progress-fill { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; bottom: 0; width: 0%; transition: width 0.15s linear, background 0.25s ease; }
  .yt-dl-progress-text { position: relative; z-index: 1; font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 1px; color: #fff; text-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.9), 0 0 2px rgba(0,0,0,1); }


  .yt-sheet { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 120; display: none; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: center; background: rgba(3, 0, 10, 0.72); backdrop-filter: blur(3px); }
  .yt-sheet.show { display: flex; }
  .yt-sheet-inner { width: 100%; max-width: 560px; max-height: 88vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; background: rgba(10, 5, 25, 0.98); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 48, 48, 0.35); border-radius: 20px 20px 0 0; padding: 16px 16px 14px; box-shadow: 0 -10px 34px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65); animation: ytUp 0.22s ease; }
  @keyframes ytUp { from { transform: translateY(26px); opacity: 0; } to { transform: none; opacity: 1; } }
  .yt-sheet-head { display: flex; gap: 11px; align-items: center; padding-bottom: 12px; border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.22); }
  .yt-sheet-thumb { width: 78px; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; border-radius: 9px; object-fit: cover; background: #000; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 48, 48, 0.4); flex-shrink: 0; }
  .yt-sheet-info { flex: 1; min-width: 0; text-align: left; }
  .yt-sheet-title { color: #fff; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.4; display: -webkit-box; -webkit-box-orient: vertical; -webkit-line-clamp: 2; overflow: hidden; word-break: break-word; }
  .yt-sheet-sub { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 9.5px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; margin-top: 5px; line-height: 1.5; }
  .yt-sheet-x { width: 33px; height: 33px; flex-shrink: 0; border-radius: 10px; background: transparent; border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.4); color: #fca5a5; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; font-size: 13px; transition: all 0.2s; }
  .yt-sheet-x:hover { background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.14); color: #fff; }
  .yt-tabs { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 6px; margin: 12px 0 10px; padding: 4px; background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.04); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.18); border-radius: 11px; }
  .yt-tab { padding: 9px 6px; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 8px; background: transparent; color: #64748b; font-family: inherit; font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 6px; transition: all 0.2s; }
  .yt-tab.active { color: #fff; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 0, 229, 0.25), rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.25)); border-color: rgba(255, 48, 48, 0.55); box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 48, 48, 0.22); }
  .yt-tab:hover:not(.active) { color: #cbd5e1; background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.05); }
  .yt-opts { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 7px; flex: 1 1 auto; min-height: 0; overflow-y: auto; padding-right: 2px; }
  .yt-opts::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 5px; }
  .yt-opts::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: rgba(255, 48, 48, 0.4); border-radius: 3px; }
  .yt-opt { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 9px 11px; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.16); border-radius: 11px; background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.03); }
  .yt-opt:hover { border-color: rgba(255, 48, 48, 0.42); background: rgba(255, 48, 48, 0.05); }
  .yt-opt-info { flex: 1; min-width: 0; text-align: left; }
  .yt-opt-name { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; flex-wrap: wrap; color: #fff; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.4px; }
  .yt-opt-sub { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 9.5px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; margin-top: 4px; }
  .yt-opt-badge { font-size: 8.5px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.6px; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 20px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.45); color: #86efac; background: rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.08); }
  .yt-opt-badge.mute { border-color: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.45); color: #fcd34d; background: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.08); }
  .yt-opt-badge.svfrom { border-color: rgba(255, 0, 229, 0.5); color: #f0abfc; background: rgba(255, 0, 229, 0.08); }
  .yt-opt-btn { position: relative; overflow: hidden; width: 42px; height: 36px; flex-shrink: 0; border: none; border-radius: 9px; cursor: pointer; color: #fff; font-family: inherit; font-size: 13px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--clr-c), var(--clr-b), var(--clr-a)); box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 0, 229, 0.25); transition: transform 0.15s; }
  .yt-opt-btn:hover:not(:disabled) { transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .yt-opt-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.75; cursor: not-allowed; }
  .yt-sheet-note { margin-top: 11px; padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px dashed rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.18); color: #7dd3fc; font-size: 9.5px; line-height: 1.65; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; }
  .yt-sheet-note b { color: #fff; }
  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .yt-meta { align-items: flex-start; }
    .yt-thumb { width: 96px; }
    .yt-item { align-items: stretch; flex-direction: column; }
    .yt-item .tt-dl-btn { width: 100%; min-width: 0; }
  }
  .bottom-nav-wrap { position: fixed; bottom: 18px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); z-index: 80; width: calc(100% - 32px); max-width: 460px; padding: 0 8px; }
  .bottom-nav { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-around; background: rgba(10, 5, 25, 0.95); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.35); border-radius: 26px; padding: 8px 4px; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.15); position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .nav-btn { flex: 1; background: transparent; border: none; color: #64748b; font-family: inherit; cursor: pointer; padding: 8px 2px; border-radius: 18px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 4px; transition: color 0.2s, background 0.2s; position: relative; outline: none; min-width: 0; }
  .nav-btn i { font-size: 17px; transition: transform 0.2s; }
  .nav-btn .nav-logo-img { width: 21px; height: 21px; object-fit: contain; transition: transform 0.2s; }
  .nav-btn span { font-size: 8.5px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.8px; text-transform: uppercase; white-space: nowrap; }
  .nav-btn:hover:not(.active) { color: #cbd5e1; background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.05); }
  .nav-btn.active { color: #fff; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(157, 0, 255, 0.25), rgba(255, 0, 229, 0.25), rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.25)); border: 1px solid var(--clr-a); }
  .nav-btn.active i { text-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--clr-a); transform: scale(1.1); }
  .nav-btn.active .nav-logo-img { transform: scale(1.1); }
  .foot-wrap { position: relative; z-index: 2; text-align: center; padding: 0 16px 24px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; }
  .copy-note { font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; letter-spacing: 0.5px; line-height: 1.9; }
  .copy-note .brand-tag { color: var(--clr-a); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; }
  .copy-note a { color: var(--clr-b); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; }
  .srv-info { margin-top: 8px; font-size: 10.5px; color: #64748b; letter-spacing: 0.8px; line-height: 2; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; align-items: center; }
  .srv-info .row { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .srv-info i { color: var(--clr-a); font-size: 10px; opacity: 0.85; }
  .srv-info .lbl { color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 1px; }
  .srv-info code { color: var(--clr-d); background: rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.08); padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 5px; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.3); font-size: 10.5px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; }
  .prof-sheet { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 100; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8); display: none; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 20px 16px; }
  .prof-sheet.show { display: flex; }
  .prof-inner { width: 100%; max-width: 420px; background: rgba(10, 5, 25, 0.98); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.4); border-radius: 20px; padding: 26px 22px 22px; box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.2); position: relative; overflow: hidden; max-height: 90vh; overflow-y: auto; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; }
  .prof-x { position: absolute; top: 12px; right: 12px; width: 34px; height: 34px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(255, 0, 229, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 0, 229, 0.35); color: var(--clr-b); cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 14px; z-index: 2; }
  .prof-x:hover { background: rgba(255, 0, 229, 0.2); }
  .prof-pic-wrap { display: flex; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .prof-pic { width: 110px; height: 110px; border-radius: 50%; border: 3px solid var(--clr-a); box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.4); object-fit: cover; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 900; color: #fff; font-size: 44px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--clr-c), var(--clr-b)); }
  .prof-display { text-align: center; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 1.5px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--clr-a), var(--clr-b), var(--clr-c)); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .prof-badge { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: 10.5px; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 20px; letter-spacing: 1px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0 auto 16px; width: fit-content; }
  .prof-badge.ok { color: var(--clr-d); background: rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.4); }
  .prof-badge.no { color: #fbbf24; background: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.4); }
  .prof-head { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .prof-rows { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 9px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .prof-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 11px 13px; background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.04); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.18); border-radius: 10px; }
  .prof-row:hover { background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.08); border-color: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.4); }
  .prof-row .f-ico { width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 8px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(157, 0, 255, 0.25), rgba(255, 0, 229, 0.25)); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.3); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--clr-a); font-size: 13px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .prof-row .f-body { flex: 1; min-width: 0; text-align: left; }
  .prof-row .f-label { font-size: 9.5px; color: #94a3b8; letter-spacing: 1.2px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 2px; }
  .prof-row .f-value { font-size: 12px; color: #e0f7ff; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-all; line-height: 1.4; }
  .prof-row .copy-btn { background: transparent; border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.3); color: var(--clr-a); width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 7px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .prof-row .copy-btn:hover { background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.12); }
  .prof-row .copy-btn.copied { color: var(--clr-d); border-color: rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.5); background: rgba(0, 255, 157, 0.1); }
  .prof-signout { width: 100%; padding: 13px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 0, 229, 0.5); border-radius: 10px; background: transparent; color: var(--clr-b); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; }
  .prof-signout:hover { background: rgba(255, 0, 229, 0.12); color: #fff; }
  .ring { display: inline-block; width: 13px; height: 13px; border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25); border-top-color: #fff; border-radius: 50%; animation: rotate 0.8s linear infinite; margin-right: 8px; vertical-align: -2px; }
  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    body { padding-bottom: 96px; }
    .card-box, .tut-card, .tt-card, .tm-card, .api-card { padding: 24px 18px 20px; }
    .brand-name, .tt-name, .tm-name { font-size: 19px; letter-spacing: 2px; }
    .progress-bar { gap: 6px; }
    .prog-node { padding: 6px 10px; font-size: 10px; }
    .prog-node span.txt { display: none; }
    .brand-logo { width: 80px; height: 80px; }
    .top-avatar-wrap { top: 12px; right: 12px; }
    .top-avatar { width: 46px; height: 46px; }
    .top-avatar .avatar-inner { font-size: 18px; }
    .prof-pic { width: 90px; height: 90px; font-size: 36px; }
    .prof-display { font-size: 16px; }
    .tut-card { padding: 20px 16px 18px; }
    .tut-header .tut-title { font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; }
    .tut-body .tut-name { font-size: 12px; }
    .tut-body .tut-desc { font-size: 11px; }
    .tt-src-tabs { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    .tt-logo { width: 70px; height: 70px; }
    .tt-logo i { font-size: 48px; }
    .tm-logo { width: 70px; height: 70px; }
    .tm-logo i { font-size: 44px; }
    .bottom-nav-wrap { bottom: 14px; width: calc(100% - 20px); max-width: none; }
    .bottom-nav { padding: 6px 3px; border-radius: 22px; }
    .nav-btn { padding: 7px 2px; }
    .nav-btn i { font-size: 15px; }
    .nav-btn .nav-logo-img { width: 19px; height: 19px; }
    .nav-btn span { font-size: 7.5px; letter-spacing: 0.3px; }
    .tm-email-show .tm-email-txt { font-size: 11.5px; }
    .tm-action-btn { font-size: 9px; padding: 8px 4px; }
    .tm-auto-refresh { font-size: 9px; padding: 5px 8px; }
    .api-card { padding: 20px 16px 18px; }
    .api-title { font-size: 13px; }
    .api-code { font-size: 10px; padding: 10px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="grd-bg"></div>

<div class="top-avatar-wrap" id="avatarCorner" title="Profile">
  <div class="top-avatar">
    <div class="avatar-inner">
      <img id="uPhoto" src="" alt="" style="display:none;"
        onerror="this.style.display='none';this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex';">
      <div id="uLetter" style="display:none;">?</div>
    </div>
    <span class="online-dot"></span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page-wrap">

  <div class="tab-page active" id="page-am">
    <div class="card-box">
      <div class="top-area">
        <div class="brand-logo">
          <img src="image/am.png" alt="AM Logo" onerror="this.replaceWith(Object.assign(document.createElement('i'),{className:'fa-solid fa-shield-halved',style:'font-size:60px;color:#fff;'}))">
        </div>
        <div class="brand-name">AM Premium</div>
        <div class="brand-sub">Alight Motion Premium API</div>
      </div>

      <div class="progress-bar">
        <div class="prog-node active" id="nd1">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-envelope"></i>
          <span class="txt">Send</span>
        </div>
        <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right prog-arrow"></i>
        <div class="prog-node" id="nd2">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-unlock-keyhole"></i>
          <span class="txt">Verify</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="view-section active" id="sec-send">
        <div class="lbl-row"><i class="fa-solid fa-at"></i> Email Address</div>
        <div class="inp-box">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-envelope ico-left"></i>
          <input type="email" id="emailAddr" placeholder="contoh@gmail.com" autocomplete="email">
        </div>
        <button class="act-btn act-btn-main" id="doSend">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-paper-plane"></i> Send Magic Link
        </button>
        <div class="msg-box" id="msg-send"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="view-section" id="sec-verify">
        <div class="lbl-row"><i class="fa-solid fa-at"></i> Email Address</div>
        <div class="inp-box">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-envelope ico-left"></i>
          <input type="email" id="emailCheck" placeholder="contoh@gmail.com" autocomplete="email">
        </div>
        <div class="lbl-row"><i class="fa-solid fa-link"></i> Magic Link</div>
        <div class="inp-box">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-key ico-left"></i>
          <textarea id="linkInput" placeholder="https://alight-creative.firebaseapp.com/__/auth/action?..."></textarea>
        </div>
        <button class="act-btn act-btn-main" id="doVerify">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-unlock-keyhole"></i> Verify Premium
        </button>
        <button class="act-btn act-btn-back" id="goBack">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i> Kembali
        </button>
        <div class="msg-box" id="msg-verify"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="tut-card">
      <div class="tut-header">
        <div class="tut-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-book-open-reader"></i></div>
        <div class="tut-title-box">
          <div class="tut-title">Cara Penggunaan</div>
          <div class="tut-sub">// Tutorial Step-by-Step</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tut-step">
        <div class="tut-num">1</div>
        <div class="tut-body">
          <div class="tut-name"><i class="fa-solid fa-envelope"></i> Masukkan Email</div>
          <div class="tut-desc">Ketik email <b>Alight Motion</b> di kolom <code>Email Address</code>, klik <b>Send Magic Link</b>.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tut-step">
        <div class="tut-num">2</div>
        <div class="tut-body">
          <div class="tut-name"><i class="fa-solid fa-inbox"></i> Cek Inbox / Spam</div>
          <div class="tut-desc">Buka Gmail, cek folder <b>Spam</b>. Cari email dari <code>noreplay</code>.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tut-step">
        <div class="tut-num">3</div>
        <div class="tut-body">
          <div class="tut-name"><i class="fa-solid fa-hand-pointer"></i> Klik Tombol Login</div>
          <div class="tut-desc">Tekan lama <b>Sign in to Alight Creative</b>, pilih <b>Copy URL</b>.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tut-step">
        <div class="tut-num">4</div>
        <div class="tut-body">
          <div class="tut-name"><i class="fa-solid fa-paste"></i> Paste Magic Link</div>
          <div class="tut-desc">Tempel link di kolom <code>Magic Link</code>, klik <b>Verify Premium</b>.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tut-step">
        <div class="tut-num">5</div>
        <div class="tut-body">
          <div class="tut-name"><i class="fa-solid fa-crown"></i> Premium Aktif!</div>
          <div class="tut-desc">Buka <b>Alight Motion</b> login pakai Google yang sama. Premium aktif <b>1 Tahun</b>. 🎉</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tut-note">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i>
        <div>Link magic cuma berlaku <b>sekali pakai</b>. Kalau gagal, coba kirim ulang dari step 1.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="tut-warn">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation"></i>
        <div>Jangan bagikan <b>magic link</b> ke orang lain!</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="tab-page" id="page-downloader">

    <div class="dl-tabs">
      <button class="dl-tab active" data-dltab="tiktok" type="button">
        <i class="fa-brands fa-tiktok"></i> TikTok
      </button>
      <button class="dl-tab" data-dltab="youtube" type="button">
        <i class="fa-brands fa-youtube"></i> YouTube DL
      </button>
      <button class="dl-tab" data-dltab="spotify" type="button">
        <i class="fa-brands fa-spotify"></i> Spotify
      </button>
      <button class="dl-tab" data-dltab="soundcloud" type="button">
        <i class="fa-brands fa-soundcloud"></i> SoundCloud
      </button>
    </div>

    <div class="dl-panel active" id="dl-panel-tiktok">
    <div class="tt-card">
      <div class="tt-header">
        <div class="tt-logo"><i class="fa-brands fa-tiktok"></i></div>
        <div class="tt-name">TikTok Downloader</div>
        <div class="tt-sub">No Watermark • Slide & Video</div>
      </div>
      <div class="lbl-row"><i class="fa-solid fa-link"></i> TikTok URL</div>
      <div class="inp-box">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-globe ico-left"></i>
        <input type="text" id="ttUrl" placeholder="https://www.tiktok.com/@user/video/..." autocomplete="off">
      </div>
